WEBVTT

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:30.409
Zašto je jednodimenzionalan?

00:10:30.409 --> 00:10:31.977
Zato što je zvuk.

00:10:31.977 --> 00:10:33.516
Jednodimenzionalan je takođe

00:10:33.516 --> 00:10:35.121
jer su nam usta tako napravljena.

00:10:35.121 --> 00:10:38.233
Naša usta su stvorena
da stvaraju jednodimenzionalni zvuk.

00:10:38.233 --> 00:10:41.099
Ali ako razmislite, mozak,

00:10:41.099 --> 00:10:42.863
misli koje imamo u glavi,

00:10:42.863 --> 00:10:44.965
nisu jednodimenzionalne.

00:10:44.965 --> 00:10:46.424
Imamo ove bogate,

00:10:46.424 --> 00:10:49.452
komplikovane, multi-dimenzionalne ideje.

00:10:49.452 --> 00:10:51.142
Čini mi se da je jezik

00:10:51.142 --> 00:10:53.474
u stvari izum mozga

00:10:53.474 --> 00:10:56.570
kojim pretvara ovu bogatu,
multi-dimenzionalnu misao

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:58.157
s jedne strane

00:10:58.157 --> 00:11:00.080
u govor s druge strane.